sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor U as User
    participant FE as Frontend
    participant API as /api/ask
    participant GW as Gateway
    participant P as Pipeline
    participant L as OpenAI
    participant S as Run store
    U->>FE: question
    FE->>API: POST question, samples
    API->>GW: route_question
    GW->>L: classify (T=0)
    L-->>GW: category
    GW->>P: process
    loop each step / claim
        P->>L: sample, verify
        L-->>P: samples, p_true
        P->>P: fuse, calibrate
    end
    P-->>API: answer, steps, confidence
    API->>S: save run
    API-->>FE: JSON
    FE-->>U: gauge, charts, chain
